-- The phường / xã of Hà Nội, TP.HCM and Đà Nẵng after the 1 July 2025 reform
-- (NQ 1656, 1685, 1659/NQ-UBTVQH15), with a centre each, so an address or a
-- casting call can name today's ward and still be priced from a point.
--
-- The quận rows stay: addresses and profiles saved with one keep their centre
-- until the person picks a ward. Generated by `npx tsx scripts/gen-wards.ts --sql`
-- from scripts/data/wards-2026.json (lib/wards.ts is the same list).

